{
  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VzvrhoBy\">整个账户关系中，会涉及到4个重要对象：</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t68f138c-blUC3US3\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"847px\" style=\"width: 847px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-Q84bOda9\"><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-CnTfiOop\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.293978748524204%\"/><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-GpfjFB4l\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.293978748524204%\"/><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-bOED6oKq\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.293978748524204%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-YhaNDIJS\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-q62LEm4T\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-F2aRBWRd\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YF983B4F\">帐号类型</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-Ca9E7CV1\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-z4UMPWaF\">系统标识</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-2ZckIm9P\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4YuwSrGz\">含义</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-KR3ZCXXF\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-8ZSVKCab\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-eCpfyqIk\">登录帐号</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-k6jGVKMa\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-s2oFqjK7\">uid</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-JWVZlMPE\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VYeT6IZ5\">客户通过手机号/邮箱登录的帐号，在巨量体系内会有一个uid作为标识，可通过 获取授权User信息 拉取到id，邮箱和用户名</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-wxrJcNvX\">目前商家后台，巨量投放后台，代理商一站式平台底层登录账户体系为同一个</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-MjIbiaT7\">整体授权是基于uid展开的Oauth授权，token是与登录帐号是强关联的，每个token都能反查到uid</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-k70a6jBC\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-8l59lt3G\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-M4nlvn7n\">店铺账户</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-bUsiiAvB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-56FaiJnB\">shopid</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-Le7T2SOe\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-nsROIuPY\">标识一个店铺，店铺是挂在uid下面的一种资产账户</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-3nbAaHg9\">uid与店的关系角色包含两种：管理员（owner）和子账户</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ibgSIPwC\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">API目前支持管理员授权和子账户授权！</span></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-pVrVcaCi\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-iCHwUotc\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yAsIoAzf\">代理商账户</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-nLGn2B9R\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NwROl1Zw\">agent_id</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t8897229-Ld6Bj64m\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gG6Rnwlp\">标识一个代理商主体，代理商也是挂在uid下面的一种资产账户</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZRbPdREk\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">API支持管理员直接登录自己的代理商账号授权，但是不支持一站式登录商家后台后授权！</span></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-6BZ0nGpB\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-QKLRI4fX\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-59BDALLE\">千川投放账户</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-NGpkLMFE\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-e8eqnhqM\">advertiser_id</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"tc10e1ad-QVi65BB7\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QhO9y7BP\">即实际的营销投放账户，目前千川投放账户挂在 店铺账户 或 代理商账户 下</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-i3Hj8BY3\">账户分为千川直投账户（客户直接开通），千川代理账户（代理商代为开通）两种类型</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-G5uWAxvn\">故千川投放账户拉取过程为：</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-NcYz7LiI\">1. 通过接口拉取token背后对应 店铺/代理商 账户</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-xWZmTocp\">2. 通过两个接口，拉取对应店铺及代理商下的千川投放账户</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-6PlFSGwh\">    a. 通过【获取 店铺账户 下的千川投放账户】拉取店铺下的千川投放账户</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-bie1XmzX\">    b. 通过【获取 代理商账户 下的千川投放账户】拉取代理商下的千川投放账户</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-KsVAD72j\">逻辑关系示意图</p><p data-id=\"pa028eb2-H4D1once\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/eddcad5459c6470593bbaea1e6c1eb98~noop.image?x-expires=1988615786&amp;x-signature=2hOkRIwXrrbAbVUvFcHoyaSBV%2FM%3D\" style=\"width: 688px; visibility: visible; height: 514px;\"/></p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"tb195057-1cN3h31O\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"876px\" style=\"width: 876px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-Acm978ab\"><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-WUeAk9lV\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-2oHO0RYF\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"c0ddd087-876EGTfK\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-DnHgCkiH\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-e4ENXu1A\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-C1P3Soi6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KoJza87u\">关系</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-2OcJ9Cf4\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CfhI4G8f\">逻辑</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-cQ4DVjMf\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cdpTebHr\">示例</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-HY7B5mmx\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-QWW8eHri\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zT1OZtXO\">店铺相关</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-mDFRPyMr\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0YoxG1a3\">1. 一个登录账户下面显示的店铺有作为管理员身份的店铺，和作为子账户身份的店铺<br/>2. 一个店铺最多只能有一个千川直投账户，但需要客户申请开通才有千川账户<br/>3. 店铺管理员进入千川后台后，<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">除了自己的千川直投账户，还可以访问操作代理商为其开设的千川代理账户</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-ACUPZV2c\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SVq71YqW\">如上图所示，商家甲可以通过自己的店铺A申请开通一个千川直投账户，也可以由代理商丙和丁为其代开两个千川代理账户；商家甲登录千川后台时，可以访问到这3个投放账户</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-W50Zjq4a\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-MLK4qx0r\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5GwWkzZE\">代理商相关</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-HsgSFeTi\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dl28wIf8\">1. 一个代理商只能为店铺开最多一个千川代理账户<br/>2. 一个代理商可以为多个店铺开千川代理账户<br/>3. 一个店铺可以被多个代理商服务</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t182d017-WOEAFd6C\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-x6FHLggl\">如上图所示，商家甲可以被代理商丙和乙同时服务，但是丙和乙只能给商家甲各开一个千川代理账户</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-X3b4txpr\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-1WYR5eBi\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-clTbUQkn\">其他</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-kUolCf3c\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0rl3xFNY\">1. 理论上，一个手机号/邮箱可以既有代理商账户，又有店铺账户</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tb7d4c2b-95GbIKfk\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 4px 8px; border: 1px solid rgb(217, 217, 217); padding: 4px 8px; cursor: default;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-TeYa8sYg\">代理商管理员丁的手机号上除了绑定了一个代理商账户，还同时绑定了一个店铺，故其在进行API授权的时候，可以同时做两种身份的授权</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>",
  "doc_type": 1,
  "going_offline": false,
  "is_new": false,
  "path": null,
  "title": "账户关系（必读）"
}
